<item rdf:about="https://www.bankofcanada.ca/2026/09/bank-canada-board-launches-process-fill-external-deputy-governor-position/">
    <title>Bank of Canada Board launches process to fill external Deputy Governor position</title>
    <link>https://www.bankofcanada.ca/2026/09/bank-canada-board-launches-process-fill-external-deputy-governor-position/</link>
    <description>The Board of Directors of the Bank of Canada has initiated a recruitment process to fill the external Deputy Governor position left vacant by the appointment of Nicolas Vincent as a full-time Deputy Governor.</description>
    <dc:date>2026-09-10T11:00:09+00:00</dc:date>
    <dc:language>en</dc:language>

        <cb:news rdf:parseType="Resource">
            <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.cbwiki.net/wiki/index.php/RSS-CB_1.2_RDF_Schema#Announcement"/>
            <cb:simpleTitle>Bank of Canada Board launches process to fill external Deputy Governor position</cb:simpleTitle>
            <cb:occurrenceDate>2026-09-10</cb:occurrenceDate>
        </cb:news>
</item>
<item rdf:about="https://www.bankofcanada.ca/2026/09/bank-canada-unveils-new-vertical-20-bank-note/">
    <title>Bank of Canada unveils new vertical $20 bank note</title>
    <link>https://www.bankofcanada.ca/2026/09/bank-canada-unveils-new-vertical-20-bank-note/</link>
    <description>Her Excellency the Right Honourable Louise Arbour, Governor General of Canada, and the Honourable Wayne Long, Secretary of State (Canada Revenue Agency and Financial Institutions), joined Bank of Canada Governor Tiff Macklem today at an event to unveil Canada’s new vertical $20 bank note featuring a portrait of His Majesty King Charles III.</description>
    <dc:date>2026-09-03T13:20:16+00:00</dc:date>
    <dc:language>en</dc:language>

        <cb:news rdf:parseType="Resource">
            <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.cbwiki.net/wiki/index.php/RSS-CB_1.2_RDF_Schema#Announcement"/>
            <cb:simpleTitle>Bank of Canada unveils new vertical $20 bank note</cb:simpleTitle>
            <cb:occurrenceDate>2026-09-03</cb:occurrenceDate>
        </cb:news>
</item>
